From: Pedro Baltazar <pedrobtz@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Mark the files the earlier patches modify

Apache License 2.0, section 4(b): modified files must carry prominent
notices stating that they were changed. Add one line under the licence
header of every file patches 0001 and 0002 touch. tools/verify-vendor
checks that every vendored file that differs from upstream carries it.

Local to zuhtml and never offered upstream. It must mark every file any
patch in the series touches, including later ones; tools/verify-vendor
checks that.
